      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "THE BOUND THAT REPLACED THE CAP. Exempting the document only keeps its guarantee true if something still bounds its growth, otherwise \u0027bounded by construction\u0027 is an assumption rather than a checked fact. tests/Scrinia.Tests/Mcp/GuideSizeTests.cs carries BOTH halves:   1. the document stays under a ceiling of 2 * MaxResponseChars (sized off the constant, not a duplicated literal)   2. the TOOL is actually the exempted one -- not some other path that merely happens not to truncate today  If guide",
