    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "HOW TO RE-MEASURE -- do NOT derive this from the byte count. The cap compares CHARS:      $raw = [System.IO.File]::ReadAllText(\u0027src/Scrinia.Mcp/Prompts/guide.md\u0027); $raw.Length     ($raw.ToCharArray() | ? { [int]$_ -gt 127 }).Count   # non-ASCII  At resolution: bytes=8142, chars=8046, crlf=169, nonAscii=48, no BOM. Each em-dash is 1 char but 3 bytes, contributing 2 EXTRA bytes; 48 of them = 96 extra bytes, so 8142 - 96 = 8046. Getting this wrong is exactly how the error below happened.",
